# source: kind: web; name: Russian fan translation of Pokémon HeartGold (Pojirianets), aligned line by line with the English text of pret/pokeheartgold; address: pojirianets-hg; quoted term: Заводчик Птиц; relation: alternative; verification: recorded; related notes: note:74f47cdd-7ebd-5060-9ea2-f47944c15bf3
